(1) Prevention of violence against women as referred to in Article 5 letter a shall be carried out in an integrated manner coordinated by the Regional Apparatus having the main duties and functions in the field of women's empowerment and child protection.
(2) Prevention as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be carried out by involving:
